<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Tautologies</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ A.3 Tautologies ‣ Appendix A Dataset Sources and Feature Analysis ‣ Morables: A Benchmark for AssessingAbstract Moral Reasoning in LLMs with Fables" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> presents examples of tautologies utilized for the <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ADV</span> variant of <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Morables</span>. The full set of tautologies is provided in the linked repository.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A1.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tautology</span></th>
<th id="A1.T10.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T10.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Moral</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T10.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">It is what it is.</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Accept things as they are.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T10.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">What is, is.</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Embrace the present reality.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T10.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The outcome is the outcome.</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Accept what results from your endeavors.</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T10.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T10.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A1.T10.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Things are what they are.</span></td>
<td id="A1.T10.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Accept the finality of reality without resistance.</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
