<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Experimental Setup and Prompts</h2>

<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Implementation Details</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To ensure consistent and reproducible access, all models were queried via the OpenRouter API <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenRouter (2025)</a></cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Zero-shot vs Few-shot</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T16" title="Table 16 ‣ E.3 Prompts utilized ‣ Appendix E Experimental Setup and Prompts ‣ Morables: A Benchmark for AssessingAbstract Moral Reasoning in LLMs with Fables" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a> displays the comparison between 0- and 1-shot setting performance for the <span id="A5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Morables</span> dataset. Smaller models are excluded from this analysis, as they do not adhere to the format instructions without providing examples.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The performance gap is notable across most models, with a decrease in accuracy of approximately 4 to 6% when no examples are given (the substantial drop in performance for DeepSeek V3 is primarily due to a significant number of invalid response formats). Interestingly, reasoning models seem to be less susceptible to the lack of examples.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Prompts utilized</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For reproducibility and clarity, all prompts employed in this study are provided at the end of this document, each clearly labeled with the task to which it pertains.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
